.SH バージョン
The glibc implementation of \fBpthread_sigqueue\fP()  gives an error
(\fBEINVAL\fP)  on attempts to send either of the real\-time signals used
internally by the NPTL threading implementation.  See \fBnptl\fP(7)  for
details.
.SH 標準規格
GNU.
.SH 歴史
glibc 2.11.
